    <p class="text-[15px] text-v6-text leading-relaxed mt-2">
      Integration tops the Index because it is both common and the most acute pain in the corpus. Renewal
      is second because it is the most common pain even though only a third of its records are severe.
      Commissions ranks low despite being fairly common, because it is rarely acute. The honest headline:
      <strong>renewal revenue leaks worst where the CRM meets the ledger.</strong>
    </p>

